// Capital Flow Oscillator v3.4
// v3.4 (2026-10-17): the fast wave's edge line hides when the fast wave slips inside the slow wave;
//       Capital Flow signal is a gold dot in a gold ring (was the green / red dot in a gold ring);
//       TP1 / TP2 marks and alerts removed (the flow exit x stays); status box shows the higher timeframe
//       as "4H" not "240", and only divergences strong enough to draw, marked "hidden" when they are
// v3.4 (later): Blue Wave setup - Market Cipher's core strategy: deep anchor wave, smaller trigger wave,
//       entry on the trigger's turn, smooth money flow behind it (blue diamond + dashed anchor-trigger line)
// v3.4 (final passes): Capital Flow signal (gold ring on the dot: stretched wave turn + money flow + capital flow agree), thicker labelled band;
//       volume delta splits each lower-timeframe candle by body / range (closer to real taker volume),
//       small dots on every wave cross again, status box top right with clock-time ages, one Blue Wave per anchor;
//       A-grade = a green / red ring around the dot (the pink A-short dot was too close to the plain red dot);
//       divergence lines join the wave's own troughs / peaks and are only drawn when the wave itself diverges;
//       inputs hidden from the legend and alert names (display.none) so alerts read "CF Osc: ..." not a 60-value list;
//       alert messages rewritten in plain words: signal, symbol + timeframe, price, why, capital flow
// v3.4: closer to the Market Cipher B look - clean background (pressure tint off by default; when on it follows the confirmed flip state (calm blocks,
//       no bar-to-bar stripes)), MC-style level lines (100 / 60 / 53),
//       smaller A-grade dots, money flow slightly see-through (25%) and drawn over the yellow momentum, Stoch RSI and RSI lines removed (the user found them not useful; the RSI wave-edge cue stays)
// v3.3: capital flow pressure tint behind the waves and green/red flip dots, matching the CF Filter v4.6
//       overlay's cloud and flip dots (same score, same +/-20% for 2 bars flip rule)
// v3.2: smoother money flow (volume-weighted EMA + Ehlers super smoother - no bar-to-bar sawtooth),
//       one shared divergence routine for bull and bear swings; "Cipher B" money flow source
//       (VuManChu's exact formula) for side-by-side comparison
// v3.1: cleaner look - smooth HTF wave line, continuous capital flow band, divergence lines without
//       text tags, compact readout, softer money flow
// v3.0: money flow from real buy/sell volume (lower-timeframe volume delta), a higher-timeframe
//       wave behind the main waves, every signal graded A/B/C on confluence, a divergence engine
//       (regular + hidden on wave, RSI and money flow, with strength) and a plain-English readout
// Wave = momentum (default) or where price sits inside the Keltner cloud (-100 bottom edge, +100 top edge)
// Area = money flow (buying/selling pressure on this chart)
// Strip = capital flow regime (macro + leaders + sectors, basket set by the Market preset) - gates the setups
// Dots = wave turns; big dots = Cloud Edge setups (edge touch + turn + flow agrees)
// Wave edge colour = RSI overbought / oversold cue; lines = divergence

//@version=6
indicator("Capital Flow Oscillator [v3.4]", shorttitle="CF Osc", overlay=false, max_labels_count=500, max_lines_count=300)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// INPUTS - MODE
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

tradingModeInput = input.string("Auto", "Trading Mode",
     options=["Auto", "Swing", "Intraday", "Scalp"],
     group="Mode",
     tooltip="Auto: Detects chart timeframe automatically\nSwing: 4H/D/W data, slower signals\nIntraday: 15m/1H/4H data, faster signals\nScalp: 5m/15m/1H data (macro 1H/4H/1D backdrop), fastest signals", display=display.none)

autoDetectedMode = timeframe.in_seconds() <= 900 ? "Scalp" : timeframe.in_seconds() <= 14400 ? "Intraday" : "Swing"
tradingMode = tradingModeInput == "Auto" ? autoDetectedMode : tradingModeInput

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// INPUTS - DATA SOURCES
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// Market preset: picks the 8 capital flow inputs (and which way each one counts) for the
// instrument on the chart. Variable names below are slots - src_dxy is "macro 1", etc.
marketInput = input.string("Auto", "Market", options=["Auto", "Crypto", "Equities", "Metals", "Forex", "Custom"], group="Market",
     tooltip="Auto picks the basket from the chart's instrument.\nCrypto: DXY, VIX, Gold, US10Y | BTC, ETH | BTC.D, TOTAL3\nEquities: DXY, VIX, US10Y, HYG | SPY, QQQ | IWM, XLU\nMetals: DXY, US10Y, VIX, SPX | Gold, Silver | GDX, TIP\nForex: US10Y, VIX, SPX, Gold | base & quote currency index | AUDJPY, Oil\nCustom: the 8 symbols below (macro and slot 7 count inverted)", display=display.none)

orderFlowInput = input.bool(true, "Scalp Order Flow (crypto)", group="Market",
     tooltip="On Scalp mode, crypto swaps its leader/sector inputs for fast order flow: open interest x price, Coinbase premium and perp basis (Binance perps). Macro becomes a 1H/4H/1D backdrop at lower weight", display=display.none)

cust_1 = input.symbol("TVC:DXY", "Macro 1", group="Market - Custom Symbols", display=display.none)
cust_2 = input.symbol("TVC:VIX", "Macro 2", group="Market - Custom Symbols", display=display.none)
cust_3 = input.symbol("OANDA:XAUUSD", "Macro 3", group="Market - Custom Symbols", display=display.none)
cust_4 = input.symbol("TVC:US10Y", "Macro 4", group="Market - Custom Symbols", display=display.none)
cust_5 = input.symbol("BINANCE:BTCUSDT", "Leader 1", group="Market - Custom Symbols", display=display.none)
cust_6 = input.symbol("BINANCE:ETHUSDT", "Leader 2", group="Market - Custom Symbols", display=display.none)
cust_7 = input.symbol("CRYPTOCAP:BTC.D", "Sector 1 (inverted)", group="Market - Custom Symbols", display=display.none)
cust_8 = input.symbol("CRYPTOCAP:TOTAL3", "Sector 2", group="Market - Custom Symbols", display=display.none)

mktTick = str.upper(syminfo.ticker)
isMetalSym = str.contains(mktTick, "XAU") or str.contains(mktTick, "XAG") or str.contains(mktTick, "GOLD") or str.contains(mktTick, "SILVER") or mktTick == "GLD" or mktTick == "SLV" or ((str.startswith(mktTick, "GC") or str.startswith(mktTick, "SI") or str.startswith(mktTick, "MGC")) and str.contains(mktTick, "!"))
autoMarket = isMetalSym ? "Metals" : syminfo.type == "crypto" ? "Crypto" : syminfo.type == "forex" ? "Forex" : "Equities"
market = marketInput == "Auto" ? autoMarket : marketInput

ccyIndex(simple string c) =>
    c == "EUR" ? "TVC:EXY" : c == "GBP" ? "TVC:BXY" : c == "JPY" ? "TVC:JXY" : c == "CHF" ? "TVC:SXY" : c == "CAD" ? "TVC:CXY" : c == "AUD" ? "TVC:AXY" : c == "NZD" ? "TVC:ZXY" : "TVC:DXY"

fxBase = syminfo.basecurrency
fxQuote = syminfo.currency
usdBase = fxBase == "USD"

src_dxy = switch market
    "Equities" => "TVC:DXY"
    "Metals" => "TVC:DXY"
    "Forex" => "TVC:US10Y"
    "Custom" => cust_1
    => "TVC:DXY"
src_vix = switch market
    "Metals" => "TVC:US10Y"
    "Forex" => "TVC:VIX"
    "Custom" => cust_2
    => "TVC:VIX"
src_gold = switch market
    "Equities" => "TVC:US10Y"
    "Metals" => "TVC:VIX"
    "Forex" => "SP:SPX"
    "Custom" => cust_3
    => "OANDA:XAUUSD"
src_yields = switch market
    "Equities" => "AMEX:HYG"
    "Metals" => "SP:SPX"
    "Forex" => "OANDA:XAUUSD"
    "Custom" => cust_4
    => "TVC:US10Y"
src_btc = switch market
    "Equities" => "AMEX:SPY"
    "Metals" => "OANDA:XAUUSD"
    "Forex" => ccyIndex(fxBase)
    "Custom" => cust_5
    => "BINANCE:BTCUSDT"
src_eth = switch market
    "Equities" => "NASDAQ:QQQ"
    "Metals" => "OANDA:XAGUSD"
    "Forex" => ccyIndex(fxQuote)
    "Custom" => cust_6
    => "BINANCE:ETHUSDT"
src_btcd = switch market
    "Equities" => "AMEX:IWM"
    "Metals" => "AMEX:GDX"
    "Forex" => "OANDA:AUDJPY"
    "Custom" => cust_7
    => "CRYPTOCAP:BTC.D"
src_total3 = switch market
    "Equities" => "AMEX:XLU"
    "Metals" => "AMEX:TIP"
    "Forex" => "TVC:USOIL"
    "Custom" => cust_8
    => "CRYPTOCAP:TOTAL3"

// true = the input rising is BEARISH for this instrument
inv_1 = market == "Forex" ? not usdBase : true                 // DXY / US10Y: strong dollar or yields = headwind
inv_2 = true                                                     // VIX (Metals: US10Y)
inv_3 = market == "Metals" ? false : market == "Forex" ? false : true   // Metals: VIX up = safe-haven bid; Forex: SPX up = risk-on
inv_4 = market == "Equities" ? false : market == "Forex" ? usdBase : true // Equities: HYG up = credit risk-on; Forex: gold up = weak dollar
inv_5 = false                                                    // leader 1 (Forex: base currency index)
inv_6 = market == "Forex"                                        // Forex: quote currency strength = pair down
inv_7 = market == "Crypto" or market == "Custom"                 // BTC.D up = alts down; IWM/GDX/AUDJPY up = risk-on
inv_8 = market == "Equities"                                     // XLU (utilities) up = defensive rotation

// Panel labels
lbl_1 = market == "Forex" ? "US10Y" : "DXY"
lbl_2 = market == "Metals" ? "US10Y" : "VIX"
lbl_3 = market == "Equities" ? "US10Y" : market == "Metals" ? "VIX" : market == "Forex" ? "SPX" : "GOLD"
lbl_4 = market == "Equities" ? "HYG" : market == "Metals" ? "SPX" : market == "Forex" ? "GOLD" : "US10Y"
lbl_5 = market == "Equities" ? "SPY" : market == "Metals" ? "GOLD" : market == "Forex" ? fxBase : market == "Custom" ? "L1" : "BTC"
lbl_6 = market == "Equities" ? "QQQ" : market == "Metals" ? "SILVER" : market == "Forex" ? fxQuote : market == "Custom" ? "L2" : "ETH"
lbl_7 = market == "Equities" ? "IWM" : market == "Metals" ? "GDX" : market == "Forex" ? "AUDJPY" : market == "Custom" ? "S1" : "BTC.D"
lbl_8 = market == "Equities" ? "XLU" : market == "Metals" ? "TIP" : market == "Forex" ? "OIL" : market == "Custom" ? "S2" : "TOTAL3"
grp_2 = market == "Equities" ? "LEADERS" : market == "Metals" ? "METALS" : market == "Forex" ? "CURRENCIES" : market == "Custom" ? "LEADERS" : "CRYPTO"
grp_3 = market == "Equities" ? "BREADTH" : market == "Metals" ? "MINERS / REAL" : market == "Forex" ? "RISK" : "SECTORS"

flowLength = input.int(14, "Flow Calculation Length", minval=5, maxval=50, group="Settings", display=display.none)
thresholdMode = input.string("Auto", "Signal Threshold", options=["Auto", "Adaptive", "Fixed"], group="Settings",
     tooltip="Auto: adaptive on Scalp, fixed +/-0.5% on Intraday/Swing (tested better there)\nAdaptive: judge each input against its own typical move\nFixed: +/-0.5% flow (v4.5 behaviour)", display=display.none)
adaptiveThreshold = thresholdMode == "Adaptive" or (thresholdMode == "Auto" and tradingMode == "Scalp")
neutralWhenClosed = input.bool(false, "Neutral When Market Closed", group="Settings",
     tooltip="Count DXY/VIX/yields as neutral while their market is shut (weekends, overnight).\nOff = keep their last reading (tested better)", display=display.none)
adaptiveLevel = input.float(0.5, "Adaptive Sensitivity", minval=0.2, maxval=1.5, step=0.1, group="Settings",
     tooltip="How big a move counts as a signal, as a multiple of the input's typical move. Lower = more signals", display=display.none)
lookbackMode = input.string("Auto", "Lookback Mode", options=["Auto", "Manual"], group="Settings", display=display.none)
lookbackManual = input.int(100, "Manual Lookback", minval=20, maxval=500, group="Settings", display=display.none)
smoothingMode = input.string("Auto", "Smoothing", options=["Auto", "Manual"], group="Settings", display=display.none)
smoothingManual = input.int(5, "Manual Smoothing", minval=1, maxval=20, group="Settings", display=display.none)
flipLevel = input.float(0.2, "Flip Threshold", minval=0.05, maxval=0.7, step=0.05, group="Settings",
     tooltip="Same as the CF Filter overlay: the score must pass +/- this level to flip direction. Keep both indicators on the same value so their flip dots line up", display=display.none)
flipConfirm = input.int(2, "Flip Confirmation (bars)", minval=1, maxval=10, group="Settings",
     tooltip="Bars the score must stay past the threshold before the flip counts (same as the overlay)", display=display.none)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// INPUTS - WAVE
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

waveType = input.string("Momentum", "Wave Type", options=["Momentum", "Cloud Position"], group="Wave",
     tooltip="Momentum: smooth, cycling waves (WaveTrend-style momentum on price)\nCloud Position: where price sits inside the Keltner cloud (-100 = bottom edge, +100 = top edge) - the exact Cloud Edge strategy", display=display.none)
momChannelLen = input.int(10, "Momentum Channel Length", minval=3, maxval=50, group="Wave - Momentum", display=display.none)
momAvgLen = input.int(21, "Momentum Average Length", minval=3, maxval=50, group="Wave - Momentum", display=display.none)
momEdgeLevel = input.int(53, "Momentum Extreme Level", minval=20, maxval=100, group="Wave - Momentum",
     tooltip="Momentum level that counts as stretched (the 'edge') for setups", display=display.none)

keltnerLength = input.int(20, "Keltner Length", minval=5, maxval=50, group="Wave - Cloud Position",
     tooltip="Keep the same as the overlay so -100/+100 line up with its cloud edges.", display=display.none)
keltnerMult = input.float(2.0, "Keltner Multiplier", minval=0.5, maxval=5.0, step=0.1, group="Wave - Cloud Position", display=display.none)
waveFastLen = input.int(4, "Wave Smoothing", minval=1, maxval=20, group="Wave - Cloud Position",
     tooltip="Higher = smoother waves, slightly later turns", display=display.none)
waveSlowLen = input.int(6, "Slow Wave Lag", minval=2, maxval=15, group="Wave - Cloud Position",
     tooltip="Higher = more gap between the waves, so the light leading edge stands out more", display=display.none)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// INPUTS - SETUPS
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

edgeLevel = input.int(90, "Cloud Edge Level", minval=50, maxval=150, group="Setups",
     tooltip="Cloud Position only: wave level that counts as price touching the cloud edge. 100 = exactly on the outer Keltner band", display=display.none)
obosLevel = input.int(60, "Overbought / Oversold Level", minval=20, maxval=100, group="Setups", display=display.none)
edgeMemory = input.int(5, "Edge Touch Memory (bars)", minval=1, maxval=20, group="Setups",
     tooltip="How recently the wave must have touched the edge for a turn to count as a setup", display=display.none)
minFlow = input.float(0.05, "Min Flow for Setup", minval=0.0, maxval=0.5, step=0.05, group="Setups",
     tooltip="Flow score needed to call the cloud green (long) or red (short)", display=display.none)
strongFlow = input.float(0.5, "A+ Flow Threshold", minval=0.2, maxval=0.9, step=0.05, group="Setups",
     tooltip="Not used for grading since v3.0 (kept so saved settings still load)", display=display.none)
setupGrade = input.string("B", "Setup Grade (TP tracking + setup alerts)", options=["A", "B"], group="Setups",
     tooltip="Every wave turn is graded on 5 checks: wave stretched, higher-timeframe wave, money flow, capital flow, recent divergence.\nOnly turns from a stretched wave can grade above C.\nA = stretched + 3 more (green / red ring), B = stretched + 2 more (outlined dot), C = the rest (small dot)", display=display.none)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// INPUTS - HIGHER-TIMEFRAME WAVE
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

htfInput = input.string("Auto", "Higher Timeframe", options=["Auto", "Off", "60", "240", "1D", "1W"], group="Higher-Timeframe Wave",
     tooltip="A faint wave behind the main waves: the same momentum wave on a higher timeframe (closed bars only, no repaint).\nAuto: 15m and below -> 1H, up to 1H -> 4H, up to 4H -> 1D, daily -> 1W", display=display.none)
showHtfWave = input.bool(true, "Show Higher-Timeframe Wave", group="Higher-Timeframe Wave", display=display.none)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// INPUTS - DIVERGENCE ENGINE
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

divPivotLeft = input.int(5, "Pivot Lookback (bars left)", minval=2, maxval=20, group="Divergence",
     tooltip="A price swing low/high must be the lowest/highest of this many bars before it (and 2 bars after)", display=display.none)
divMaxGap = input.int(60, "Max Bars Between Swings", minval=10, maxval=200, group="Divergence", display=display.none)
divMinStrength = input.int(2, "Min Strength to Draw", minval=1, maxval=3, group="Divergence",
     tooltip="Strength = how many of wave / RSI / money flow show the divergence (1-3). Weaker ones still count for grading", display=display.none)
divHidden = input.bool(true, "Include Hidden Divergences", group="Divergence",
     tooltip="Hidden: price makes a higher low (lower high) while the oscillators make a lower low (higher high) - trend continuation", display=display.none)
divDrawHidden = input.bool(false, "Draw Hidden Divergences", group="Divergence",
     tooltip="Hidden divergences always count towards signal grades; this only controls whether their lines are drawn", display=display.none)
divMemory = input.int(12, "Divergence Counts for Grading (bars)", minval=2, maxval=50, group="Divergence", display=display.none)

// Blue Wave (Market Cipher's core setup): a deep anchor wave, then a smaller trigger wave,
// entry where the trigger turns (light blue -> dark blue), with smooth money flow behind it
showCF = input.bool(true, "Show Capital Flow Signals", group="Capital Flow Signal",
     tooltip="The signature signal: momentum, money and macro agree.\nA wave turn from a stretched level (past the setup edge), money flow turning the same way, and capital flow on the same side (confirmed flip state + score). Shown as a thin gold ring around the dot", display=display.none)
alertCF = input.bool(true, "Capital Flow Signal Alerts", group="Capital Flow Signal", display=display.none)
showBlueWave = input.bool(true, "Show Blue Wave Setups", group="Blue Wave",
     tooltip="Blue diamond (below the wave for longs, above for shorts) where a deep anchor wave is followed by a smaller trigger wave and the trigger turns. A dashed blue line links the anchor and trigger", display=display.none)
bwAnchorDepth = input.int(53, "Anchor Depth", minval=20, maxval=100, group="Blue Wave",
     tooltip="The anchor wave must reach past this level (53 = the inner MC line, 60 = the outer one)", display=display.none)
bwTriggerRatio = input.float(0.8, "Trigger Max Size (x anchor)", minval=0.3, maxval=1.0, step=0.05, group="Blue Wave",
     tooltip="The trigger wave must be at most this fraction as deep as the anchor - noticeably smaller", display=display.none)
bwMaxBounce = input.int(20, "Max Bounce Between Waves", minval=-40, maxval=60, group="Blue Wave",
     tooltip="How far the wave may bounce (past zero, towards the other side) between the anchor and the trigger. Bigger bounces mean the two waves are not one setup", display=display.none)
bwMaxGap = input.int(40, "Anchor Lookback (bars)", minval=5, maxval=200, group="Blue Wave",
     tooltip="The anchor is the deepest dip within this many bars before the trigger wave starts", display=display.none)
bwNeedMF = input.bool(true, "Require Money Flow Turning", group="Blue Wave",
     tooltip="Money flow must be moving the trade's way over the last few bars (rising for longs, falling for shorts)", display=display.none)
bwMfLen = input.int(5, "Money Flow Check (bars)", minval=2, maxval=20, group="Blue Wave", display=display.none)
showBwLines = input.bool(true, "Draw Anchor-Trigger Line", group="Blue Wave", display=display.none)
alertBW = input.bool(true, "Blue Wave Alerts", group="Blue Wave", display=display.none)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// INPUTS - VISUALS
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

displayStyle = input.string("Classic", "Display Style", options=["Clean", "Classic"], group="Visuals",
     tooltip="Clean: thin glowing wave lines, soft money-flow wash, solid capital flow band, fewer marks, score cards\nClassic: Market Cipher-style filled waves with the bright yellow momentum area", display=display.none)
isClean = displayStyle == "Clean"
cleanYellow = input.bool(false, "Show Yellow Momentum in Clean Style", group="Visuals", display=display.none)
showMomentum = input.bool(true, "Show Yellow Momentum Area", group="Visuals",
     tooltip="MC-style yellow area: the gap between the fast and slow waves. Flips sign slightly before the waves cross", display=display.none)
momScale = input.float(1.0, "Yellow Momentum Height", minval=0.2, maxval=2.0, step=0.1, group="Visuals",
     tooltip="Lower = slimmer yellow area, so more of the money flow shows through", display=display.none)
showMoneyFlow = input.bool(true, "Show Money Flow Area", group="Visuals", display=display.none)
stripStyle = input.string("Band", "Capital Flow Strip Style", options=["Band", "Bars"], group="Visuals",
     tooltip="Band: one continuous band that only changes shade when conviction holds for 3 bars\nBars: the original bar-by-bar columns", display=display.none)
showFlowStrip = input.bool(true, "Show Capital Flow Strip", group="Visuals",
     tooltip="Green/red strip along the bottom: the macro capital flow regime that gates setups", display=display.none)
showPressure = input.bool(false, "Show Capital Flow Pressure", group="Visuals",
     tooltip="Green/red tint behind the waves - the CF Filter overlay's cloud colour", display=display.none)
pressureMode = input.string("Flip State", "Pressure Tint Follows", options=["Flip State", "Live Score"], group="Visuals",
     tooltip="Flip State: one steady colour from flip to flip (the same as the flip dots) - calm blocks.\nLive Score: follows the score bar by bar, stronger flow = stronger tint (can look stripy)", display=display.none)
pressureStrength = input.float(1.0, "Pressure Tint Strength", minval=0.2, maxval=2.0, step=0.1, group="Visuals", display=display.none)
showFlipDots = input.bool(true, "Show Capital Flow Flip Dots", group="Visuals",
     tooltip="Green/red dots on the bottom band where capital flow flips - the same bars as the overlay's Bull/Bear Flip dots", display=display.none)
showSmallDots = input.bool(true, "Show C-Grade Dots", group="Visuals",
     tooltip="Small green/red dot on every other wave cross (C grade), like Cipher B's small dots. B and A turns get their own dots", display=display.none)
dotMinLevel = input.int(0, "Hide Cross Dots Inside ±", minval=0, maxval=80, group="Visuals",
     tooltip="Crosses near zero are mostly noise - hide their dots", display=display.none)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// INPUTS - MONEY FLOW
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

mfLength = input.int(60, "Money Flow Length", minval=5, maxval=200, group="Money Flow",
     tooltip="Bars averaged. Higher = slower", display=display.none)
mfSmooth = input.int(12, "Money Flow Smoothing", minval=1, maxval=50, group="Money Flow",
     tooltip="Extra low-lag smoothing (super smoother) on top of the average. Higher = smoother curve. 1 = off", display=display.none)
mfMult = input.float(200.0, "Money Flow Height", minval=10.0, maxval=400.0, step=10.0, group="Money Flow",
     tooltip="Money flow is scaled to its own typical size; 200 = a typical reading of about 24", display=display.none)
mfSource = input.string("Volume Delta", "Money Flow Source", options=["Volume Delta", "Candle Pressure", "Cipher B"], group="Money Flow",
     tooltip="Volume Delta: buying vs selling volume, estimated from the lower-timeframe candles inside each bar (volume x body / range). Closest of these to real exchange buy/sell volume when tested.\nCandle Pressure: candle body as a share of its range, through our smoothing.\nCipher B: VuManChu Cipher B's exact formula - a plain 60-bar SMA of body/range x 150, shifted down 2.5. Ignores volume, smoothing and normalising; Length and Height still apply (60 and 200 = theirs). Tracked real buy/sell volume worst of the three when tested.\nVolume Delta falls back to Candle Pressure where lower-timeframe data is missing", display=display.none)
mfLtfInput = input.string("Auto", "Delta Timeframe", options=["Auto", "1", "5", "15", "60"], group="Money Flow",
     tooltip="Lower timeframe used for volume delta. Auto aims for ~12-24 lower-timeframe candles per bar", display=display.none)
mfUseVolume = input.bool(true, "Weight by Volume", group="Money Flow",
     tooltip="Bigger-volume candles count more. Ignored on symbols without volume", display=display.none)
showMcLevels = input.bool(true, "MC-Style Level Lines", group="Visuals",
     tooltip="Cipher B style lines at 100, +/-60 and +/-53 (Momentum wave only)", display=display.none)
mfTransp = input.int(25, "Money Flow Transparency", minval=0, maxval=80, group="Visuals",
     tooltip="0 = solid, higher = more see-through (v3.3 used 32)", display=display.none)
showExitMarks = input.bool(true, "Show Flow Exit Marks", group="Visuals",
     tooltip="x on the wave when capital flow turns against the last graded setup", display=display.none)
showDivergence = input.bool(true, "Show Divergences", group="Visuals",
     tooltip="D marks plus a line joining the two wave pivots: wave higher low while price makes a lower low (bull), or the reverse (bear)", display=display.none)
showKey = input.bool(false, "Show Key", group="Visuals", tooltip="Boxed legend explaining each element. Off by default to keep the pane clean", display=display.none)
keyPos = input.string("Bottom Left", "Key Position", options=["Bottom Left", "Top Left", "Top Right", "Bottom Right"], group="Visuals", display=display.none)
rsiCueStyle = input.string("Wave Edge", "RSI Cue", options=["Wave Edge", "Dots", "Off"], group="RSI",
     tooltip="Wave Edge: the wave's light leading edge turns red while RSI is overbought, green while oversold\nDots: small faint dots on the wave instead\nOff: no RSI cue", display=display.none)
rsiCueLen = input.int(14, "RSI Length", minval=2, maxval=50, group="RSI", display=display.none)
rsiOB = input.int(70, "Overbought", minval=50, maxval=95, group="RSI", display=display.none)
rsiOS = input.int(30, "Oversold", minval=5, maxval=50, group="RSI", display=display.none)
showLabel = input.bool(true, "Show Status Box", group="Visuals", display=display.none)
labelPos = input.string("Top Right", "Status Box Position", options=["Top Right", "Bottom Right", "Top Left", "Bottom Left"], group="Visuals", display=display.none)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// INPUTS - ALERTS
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

alertSetups = input.bool(true, "Setup Alerts (graded)", group="Alerts", display=display.none)
alertAPlusOnly = input.bool(false, "Only Alert A-Grade Setups", group="Alerts", display=display.none)
alertDiv = input.bool(false, "Divergence Alerts", group="Alerts", display=display.none)
alertExit = input.bool(true, "Flow Exit Alerts", group="Alerts", display=display.none)
alertCooldown = input.int(3, "Setup Alert Cooldown (bars)", minval=1, maxval=50, group="Alerts", display=display.none)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// COLORS
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

wave_fast = #5AB4FF
wave_slow = #1B2A80
momentum_color = #FFE45C
flow_bull = #2EE86B
flow_bear = #FF4A3D
dot_bull = #3FFF7F
dot_bear = #FF4D4D
exit_color = #9E9E9E
div_bull = #2EE86B
div_bear = #FF4A3D
level_color = #787B86
rsi_ob = #FF6B8A
rsi_os = #6CFFB0

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// TIMEFRAME SELECTION BY MODE
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

tf1 = switch tradingMode
    "Swing" => "240"
    "Intraday" => "15"
    "Scalp" => "5"
    => "240"

tf2 = switch tradingMode
    "Swing" => "1D"
    "Intraday" => "60"
    "Scalp" => "15"
    => "1D"

tf3 = switch tradingMode
    "Swing" => "1W"
    "Intraday" => "240"
    "Scalp" => "60"
    => "1W"

// Scalp: macro moves too slowly for 5m data - read it as a 1H/4H/1D backdrop instead
mtf1 = tradingMode == "Scalp" ? "60" : tf1
mtf2 = tradingMode == "Scalp" ? "240" : tf2
mtf3 = tradingMode == "Scalp" ? "1D" : tf3

tf1_weight = 1.0
tf2_weight = 2.0
tf3_weight = 3.0
totalTfWeight = tf1_weight + tf2_weight + tf3_weight

autoLookback = switch tradingMode
    "Swing" => timeframe.in_seconds() <= 3600 ? 200 : timeframe.in_seconds() <= 14400 ? 100 : timeframe.in_seconds() <= 86400 ? 50 : 25
    "Intraday" => timeframe.in_seconds() <= 900 ? 400 : timeframe.in_seconds() <= 3600 ? 200 : 100
    "Scalp" => timeframe.in_seconds() <= 300 ? 600 : timeframe.in_seconds() <= 900 ? 400 : 200
    => 100

lookback = lookbackMode == "Auto" ? autoLookback : lookbackManual

baseSmoothing = switch tradingMode
    "Swing" => timeframe.in_seconds() < 3600 ? 8 : timeframe.in_seconds() < 14400 ? 5 : timeframe.in_seconds() < 86400 ? 3 : 1
    "Intraday" => timeframe.in_seconds() < 900 ? 5 : timeframe.in_seconds() < 3600 ? 3 : 2
    "Scalp" => timeframe.in_seconds() < 300 ? 3 : 2
    => 3

smoothing = smoothingMode == "Auto" ? baseSmoothing : smoothingManual

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// HELPER FUNCTIONS
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

calcFlow(float src, int len) =>
    roc = ta.roc(src, len)
    ta.ema(roc, len)

// Adaptive: flow as a multiple of the symbol's own typical move, so one threshold fits every
// timeframe and market. Fixed: raw % flow (v4.5 behaviour).
calcFlowOffset(int len, int off) =>
    f = calcFlow(close, len)
    scale = ta.sma(math.abs(ta.roc(close, len)), 100)
    v = adaptiveThreshold ? (scale > 0 ? f / scale : 0.0) : f
    [v[off], time[off]]

// Non-repainting request: higher timeframes use the last CLOSED bar ([1] + lookahead_on),
// so history and live bars show the same values. Lower timeframes are already closed bars.
// Optionally, closed markets (weekends, outside US hours) count as neutral instead of their last reading.
getFlow(simple string sym, simple string tf) =>
    bool htf = timeframe.in_seconds(tf) >= timeframe.in_seconds()
    int off = htf ? 1 : 0
    // NOTE: calcFlowOffset reads adaptiveThreshold, which depends on the timeframe. Inside
    // request.security Pine re-evaluates it in the REQUESTED context, so lower-timeframe reads
    // (e.g. 15m on a 3H/4H chart) can come back volatility-scaled. The v4.6.0 backtests depend on
    // this; replacing it with an explicit per-timeframe rule changed 3H from +47% to +19% (see
    // lab/README.md). Do not "simplify" this without re-running the strategy.
    [f, t] = request.security(sym, tf, calcFlowOffset(flowLength, off), lookahead=htf ? barmerge.lookahead_on : barmerge.lookahead_off, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
    stale = neutralWhenClosed and (na(t) or time - t > (3 * timeframe.in_seconds(tf) + timeframe.in_seconds()) * 1000)
    stale ? 0.0 : nz(f)

getSignal(float flow, bool invert) =>
    threshold = adaptiveThreshold ? adaptiveLevel : 0.5
    rawSignal = flow > threshold ? 1.0 : flow < -threshold ? -1.0 : 0.0
    invert ? -rawSignal : rawSignal

calcCorrelation(float signal, int len) =>
    signalThreshold = 0.3
    priceUp = close > close[1]
    signalBull = signal > signalThreshold
    signalBear = signal < -signalThreshold
    signalActive = math.abs(signal) > signalThreshold
    correctBull = signalBull and priceUp ? 1.0 : 0.0
    correctBear = signalBear and not priceUp ? 1.0 : 0.0
    correct = correctBull + correctBear
    active = signalActive ? 1.0 : 0.0
    correctSum = math.sum(correct, len)
    activeSum = math.sum(active, len)
    activeSum > 10 ? (correctSum / activeSum) * 100 : 50.0

calcEdge(float corr) =>
    math.abs(corr - 50) / 50

calcMultiplier(float corr) =>
    corr >= 50 ? 1.0 : -1.0

calcWeight(float corr) =>
    0.2 + 0.8 * calcEdge(corr)

combineTf(float s1, float s2, float s3) =>
    (s1 * tf1_weight + s2 * tf2_weight + s3 * tf3_weight) / totalTfWeight

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// FLOW ENGINE (same logic as overlay v4.5, without repainting)
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

tickerUpper = str.upper(syminfo.ticker)
isBTC = str.contains(tickerUpper, "BTC") and not str.contains(tickerUpper, "BTC.D")
isETH = str.contains(tickerUpper, "ETH")

macroMult = (market != "Crypto" ? 1.0 : isBTC ? 1.2 : isETH ? 1.1 : 0.9) * (tradingMode == "Scalp" ? 0.6 : 1.0)
cryptoMult = market != "Crypto" ? 1.0 : isBTC ? 1.0 : isETH ? 1.1 : 1.0
sectorMult = market != "Crypto" ? 1.0 : isBTC ? 0.8 : isETH ? 1.0 : 1.3

sig_dxy = combineTf(getSignal(getFlow(src_dxy, mtf1), inv_1), getSignal(getFlow(src_dxy, mtf2), inv_1), getSignal(getFlow(src_dxy, mtf3), inv_1))
sig_vix = combineTf(getSignal(getFlow(src_vix, mtf1), inv_2), getSignal(getFlow(src_vix, mtf2), inv_2), getSignal(getFlow(src_vix, mtf3), inv_2))
sig_gold = combineTf(getSignal(getFlow(src_gold, mtf1), inv_3), getSignal(getFlow(src_gold, mtf2), inv_3), getSignal(getFlow(src_gold, mtf3), inv_3))
sig_yields = combineTf(getSignal(getFlow(src_yields, mtf1), inv_4), getSignal(getFlow(src_yields, mtf2), inv_4), getSignal(getFlow(src_yields, mtf3), inv_4))

sig_btc = combineTf(getSignal(getFlow(src_btc, tf1), inv_5), getSignal(getFlow(src_btc, tf2), inv_5), getSignal(getFlow(src_btc, tf3), inv_5))
sig_eth = combineTf(getSignal(getFlow(src_eth, tf1), inv_6), getSignal(getFlow(src_eth, tf2), inv_6), getSignal(getFlow(src_eth, tf3), inv_6))

sig_btcd = getSignal(getFlow(src_btcd, tf2), inv_7)
sig_total3 = getSignal(getFlow(src_total3, tf2), inv_8)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// SCALP ORDER FLOW (crypto) - replaces the leader/sector inputs on Scalp mode
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

useOrderFlow = market == "Crypto" and tradingMode == "Scalp" and orderFlowInput
ofBase = syminfo.basecurrency
ofSpot = "BINANCE:" + ofBase + "USDT"
ofPerp = "BINANCE:" + ofBase + "USDT.P"
ofOI = "BINANCE:" + ofBase + "USDT.P_OI"
ofCB = "COINBASE:" + ofBase + "USD"

normMove(float src, int len) =>
    f = ta.ema(ta.roc(src, len), len)
    scale = ta.sma(math.abs(ta.roc(src, len)), 100)
    scale > 0 ? f / scale : 0.0

spotClose = request.security(ofSpot, timeframe.period, close, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
perpClose = request.security(ofPerp, timeframe.period, close, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
cbClose = request.security(ofCB, timeframe.period, close, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
oiClose = request.security(ofOI, timeframe.period, close, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)

ofLevel = adaptiveLevel
priceMove = normMove(close, flowLength)
oiMove = nz(normMove(oiClose, flowLength))
premMove = nz(normMove(cbClose / spotClose, flowLength))
basisMove = nz(normMove(perpClose / spotClose, flowLength))

// Rising OI confirms the price direction (new positions opening); falling OI = positions closing, no conviction
oiSig = oiMove > ofLevel ? (priceMove > ofLevel ? 1.0 : priceMove < -ofLevel ? -1.0 : 0.0) : 0.0
premSig = premMove > ofLevel ? 1.0 : premMove < -ofLevel ? -1.0 : 0.0     // Coinbase paying up = US spot buying
basisSig = basisMove > ofLevel ? 1.0 : basisMove < -ofLevel ? -1.0 : 0.0  // perps bid over spot = aggressive longs

if useOrderFlow
    sig_btc := oiSig
    sig_eth := premSig
    sig_btcd := basisSig

lbl_5 := useOrderFlow ? "OI" : lbl_5
lbl_6 := useOrderFlow ? "CB PREM" : lbl_6
lbl_7 := useOrderFlow ? "BASIS" : lbl_7
grp_2 := useOrderFlow ? "ORDER FLOW" : grp_2
grp_3 := useOrderFlow ? "BASIS / ALTS" : grp_3

corr_dxy = calcCorrelation(sig_dxy, lookback)
corr_vix = calcCorrelation(sig_vix, lookback)
corr_gold = calcCorrelation(sig_gold, lookback)
corr_yields = calcCorrelation(sig_yields, lookback)
corr_btc = calcCorrelation(sig_btc, lookback)
corr_eth = calcCorrelation(sig_eth, lookback)
corr_btcd = calcCorrelation(sig_btcd, lookback)
corr_total3 = calcCorrelation(sig_total3, lookback)

eff_dxy = sig_dxy * calcMultiplier(corr_dxy)
eff_vix = sig_vix * calcMultiplier(corr_vix)
eff_gold = sig_gold * calcMultiplier(corr_gold)
eff_yields = sig_yields * calcMultiplier(corr_yields)
eff_btc = sig_btc * calcMultiplier(corr_btc)
eff_eth = sig_eth * calcMultiplier(corr_eth)
eff_btcd = sig_btcd * calcMultiplier(corr_btcd)
eff_total3 = sig_total3 * calcMultiplier(corr_total3)

w_dxy = calcWeight(corr_dxy)
w_vix = calcWeight(corr_vix)
w_gold = calcWeight(corr_gold)
w_yields = calcWeight(corr_yields)
w_btc = calcWeight(corr_btc)
w_eth = calcWeight(corr_eth)
w_btcd = calcWeight(corr_btcd)
w_total3 = calcWeight(corr_total3)

bullCount = (eff_dxy > 0 ? 1 : 0) + (eff_vix > 0 ? 1 : 0) + (eff_gold > 0 ? 1 : 0) + (eff_yields > 0 ? 1 : 0) +
     (eff_btc > 0 ? 1 : 0) + (eff_eth > 0 ? 1 : 0) + (eff_btcd > 0 ? 1 : 0) + (eff_total3 > 0 ? 1 : 0)
bearCount = (eff_dxy < 0 ? 1 : 0) + (eff_vix < 0 ? 1 : 0) + (eff_gold < 0 ? 1 : 0) + (eff_yields < 0 ? 1 : 0) +
     (eff_btc < 0 ? 1 : 0) + (eff_eth < 0 ? 1 : 0) + (eff_btcd < 0 ? 1 : 0) + (eff_total3 < 0 ? 1 : 0)

macroScore = (eff_dxy * w_dxy + eff_vix * w_vix + eff_gold * w_gold + eff_yields * w_yields) * macroMult
macroWeights = (w_dxy + w_vix + w_gold + w_yields) * macroMult
cryptoScore = (eff_btc * w_btc + eff_eth * w_eth) * cryptoMult
cryptoWeights = (w_btc + w_eth) * cryptoMult
sectorScore = (eff_btcd * w_btcd + eff_total3 * w_total3) * sectorMult
sectorWeights = (w_btcd + w_total3) * sectorMult

totalWeights = macroWeights + cryptoWeights + sectorWeights
rawScore = totalWeights > 0.1 ? math.max(math.min((macroScore + cryptoScore + sectorScore) / totalWeights, 1.0), -1.0) : 0.0
flowScore = smoothing > 1 ? ta.ema(rawScore, smoothing) : rawScore
conviction = math.min(math.abs(flowScore), 1.0)

flowBull = flowScore > minFlow
flowBear = flowScore < -minFlow

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// WAVES
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

isMomentum = waveType == "Momentum"

kBasis = ta.ema(close, keltnerLength)
kRange = ta.atr(keltnerLength) * keltnerMult
rawPos = kRange > 0 ? (close - kBasis) / kRange * 100 : 0.0

// Display waves use hlc3 (smoother than close) and soft-compress anything beyond the
// cloud edge, so one big candle can't squash the whole pane
compressWave(float x) =>
    ax = math.abs(x)
    ax <= 100 ? x : math.sign(x) * (100 + (ax - 100) * 0.3)

wavePos = kRange > 0 ? (hlc3 - kBasis) / kRange * 100 : 0.0
cloudWave = compressWave(ta.ema(wavePos, waveFastLen))

// Momentum wave: WaveTrend-style - distance from a moving average, scaled by its
// average deviation, then smoothed. Naturally cycles back to zero
esa = ta.ema(hlc3, momChannelLen)
dev = ta.ema(math.abs(hlc3 - esa), momChannelLen)
ci = dev > 0 ? (hlc3 - esa) / (0.015 * dev) : 0.0
momWave = ta.ema(ci, momAvgLen)

wt1 = isMomentum ? momWave : cloudWave
wt2 = ta.sma(wt1, isMomentum ? 4 : waveSlowLen)
momentum = wt1 - wt2

crossUp = ta.crossover(wt1, wt2)
crossDn = ta.crossunder(wt1, wt2)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// CLOUD EDGE SETUPS
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

setupEdge = isMomentum ? momEdgeLevel : edgeLevel
touchedLower = ta.lowest(wt1, edgeMemory) <= -setupEdge
touchedUpper = ta.highest(wt1, edgeMemory) >= setupEdge

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// MONEY FLOW - volume delta (lower timeframe) or candle pressure
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// Body-share volume split: each lower-timeframe candle's volume x body / range (a full green body = all buying).
// Tested against Binance's real taker buy/sell volume (BTC + ETH, 15m-4H, 2026-10-15): it tracked real flow
// better than the old close-location split (correlation ~0.45-0.6 vs ~0.25-0.45; turns agree ~70-75% vs ~60-70%)
deltaOf() =>
    rng = high - low
    rng > 0 ? volume * (close - open) / rng : 0.0

secs = timeframe.in_seconds()
ltfAuto = secs <= 900 ? "1" : secs <= 3600 ? "5" : secs <= 14400 ? "15" : secs <= 86400 ? "60" : "240"
ltfPick = mfLtfInput == "Auto" ? ltfAuto : mfLtfInput
ltfRes = timeframe.isseconds ? timeframe.period : timeframe.in_seconds(ltfPick) <= secs ? ltfPick : ltfAuto
[ltfDelta, ltfVol] = request.security_lower_tf(syminfo.tickerid, ltfRes, [deltaOf(), volume], ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
sumVol = array.size(ltfVol) > 0 ? array.sum(ltfVol) : 0.0
deltaRatio = sumVol > 0 ? array.sum(ltfDelta) / sumVol : na

candlePressure = high > low ? (close - open) / (high - low) : 0.0
usingDelta = mfSource == "Volume Delta" and not na(deltaRatio)
pressure = usingDelta ? deltaRatio : candlePressure
// Ehlers super smoother: a 2-pole filter that removes bar-to-bar jitter with little lag
superSmooth(float src, simple int len) =>
    a = math.exp(-math.sqrt(2) * math.pi / len)
    c2 = 2 * a * math.cos(math.sqrt(2) * math.pi / len)
    c3 = -a * a
    float f = na
    f := (1 - c2 - c3) * (src + nz(src[1], src)) / 2 + c2 * nz(f[1], src) + c3 * nz(f[2], src)
    f

// Volume-weighted average pressure. EMAs, not SMAs: an SMA jumps when a big bar drops out of its window
relVolume = ta.sma(volume, mfLength)
hasVolume = mfUseVolume and not na(volume) and relVolume > 0
mfWeight = hasVolume ? math.min(volume, 3 * relVolume) : 1.0
mfAvg = ta.ema(pressure * mfWeight, mfLength) / ta.ema(mfWeight, mfLength)
mfRaw = mfSmooth > 1 ? superSmooth(mfAvg, mfSmooth) : mfAvg
// Normalised to its own typical size so volume delta and candle pressure draw at the same height
mfTypical = ta.sma(math.abs(mfRaw), 200)
isCipherMF = mfSource == "Cipher B"
// VuManChu Cipher B: sma((close - open) / (high - low) * 150, 60) - 2.5
cipherMF = ta.sma(candlePressure * 150 * mfMult / 200, mfLength) - 2.5
moneyFlow = isCipherMF ? cipherMF : mfTypical > 0 ? mfRaw / mfTypical * mfMult * 0.12 : mfRaw * mfMult
mfRising = moneyFlow > moneyFlow[3]
mfFalling = moneyFlow < moneyFlow[3]

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// HIGHER-TIMEFRAME WAVE - same momentum wave, last CLOSED higher-timeframe bar (no repaint)
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// Pure function of its arguments, so it computes identically in any requested context
waveOf(simple int chLen, simple int avgLen) =>
    e = ta.ema(hlc3, chLen)
    dv = ta.ema(math.abs(hlc3 - e), chLen)
    c = dv > 0 ? (hlc3 - e) / (0.015 * dv) : 0.0
    w1 = ta.ema(c, avgLen)
    w2 = ta.sma(w1, 4)
    [w1[1], w2[1]]

htfAuto = secs <= 900 ? "60" : secs <= 3600 ? "240" : secs <= 14400 ? "1D" : secs <= 86400 ? "1W" : "1M"
htfOn = htfInput != "Off"
htfPick = htfInput == "Auto" or htfInput == "Off" ? htfAuto : htfInput
htfRes = timeframe.in_seconds(htfPick) > secs ? htfPick : htfAuto
[htfW1, htfW2] = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, htfRes, waveOf(momChannelLen, momAvgLen), lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)
htfUp = htfOn and not na(htfW1) and (htfW1 > htfW2 or htfW1 <= -obosLevel)
htfDn = htfOn and not na(htfW1) and (htfW1 < htfW2 or htfW1 >= obosLevel)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// DIVERGENCE ENGINE - price swings vs wave, RSI and money flow; regular + hidden; strength 1-3
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

rsiDiv = ta.rsi(close, rsiCueLen)
swingLow = ta.pivotlow(low, divPivotLeft, 2)
swingHigh = ta.pivothigh(high, divPivotLeft, 2)

divParts(bool w, bool r, bool m) =>
    str.trim((w ? "wave " : "") + (r ? "RSI " : "") + (m ? "flow" : ""))

// One side of the engine: bull compares swing lows, bear compares swing highs. The var state is kept
// separately for each call. s flips every comparison for the bear side.
// Returns [strength 0-3, description]
divScan(bool isBull, float swing, color col) =>
    var float pPrice = na
    var int pBar = na
    var float pW = na
    var float pR = na
    var float pM = na
    s = isBull ? 1.0 : -1.0
    int st = 0
    string txt = ""
    if not na(swing)
        // Anchor on the wave's own trough / peak near the price swing (the wave lags price by a bar
        // or two), so lines join the wave's turning points instead of a point on its slope
        float w = wt2[2]
        int wOff = 2
        for i = 0 to divPivotLeft + 2
            if s * (wt2[i] - w) < 0
                w := wt2[i]
                wOff := i
        r = rsiDiv[2]
        m = moneyFlow[2]
        if not na(pPrice) and bar_index - 2 - pBar <= divMaxGap
            regP = s * (swing - pPrice) < 0                 // lower low / higher high
            hidP = divHidden and s * (swing - pPrice) > 0   // higher low / lower high
            rw = regP and s * (w - pW) > 0 and s * w < 0
            rr = regP and s * (r - pR) > 0
            rm = regP and s * (m - pM) > 0
            hw = hidP and s * (w - pW) < 0 and s * w < 0
            hr = hidP and s * (r - pR) < 0
            hm = hidP and s * (m - pM) < 0
            regS = (rw ? 1 : 0) + (rr ? 1 : 0) + (rm ? 1 : 0)
            hidS = (hw ? 1 : 0) + (hr ? 1 : 0) + (hm ? 1 : 0)
            isHidden = hidS > regS
            st := math.max(regS, hidS)
            if st > 0
                txt := (isHidden ? "hidden " : "") + (isBull ? "bull" : "bear") + " div (" + (isHidden ? divParts(hw, hr, hm) : divParts(rw, rr, rm)) + ")"
                // Lines are drawn on the wave, so only when the wave itself diverges
                waveDiv = isHidden ? hw : rw
                if showDivergence and waveDiv and st >= divMinStrength and (not isHidden or divDrawHidden)
                    line.new(pBar, pW, bar_index - wOff, w, color=color.new(col, isHidden ? 55 : st >= 3 ? 0 : 30),
                         width=st >= 3 ? 2 : 1, style=isHidden ? line.style_dotted : line.style_solid)
        pPrice := swing
        pBar := bar_index - wOff
        pW := w
        pR := r
        pM := m
    [st, txt]

[bullDivStrength, bullDivTxt] = divScan(true, swingLow, div_bull)
[bearDivStrength, bearDivTxt] = divScan(false, swingHigh, div_bear)
bullDiv = bullDivStrength > 0
bearDiv = bearDivStrength > 0

var int lastBullDivBar = na
var int lastBearDivBar = na
var string lastBullDivTxt = ""
var string lastBearDivTxt = ""
if bullDiv
    lastBullDivBar := bar_index - 2
    lastBullDivTxt := bullDivTxt
if bearDiv
    lastBearDivBar := bar_index - 2
    lastBearDivTxt := bearDivTxt
// The status box only reports divergences strong enough to draw (weaker ones still count for grading)
var int shownBullDivBar = na
var int shownBearDivBar = na
var bool shownBullHidden = false
var bool shownBearHidden = false
if bullDiv and bullDivStrength >= divMinStrength
    shownBullDivBar := bar_index - 2
    shownBullHidden := str.contains(bullDivTxt, "hidden")
if bearDiv and bearDivStrength >= divMinStrength
    shownBearDivBar := bar_index - 2
    shownBearHidden := str.contains(bearDivTxt, "hidden")

recentBullDiv = not na(lastBullDivBar) and bar_index - lastBullDivBar <= divMemory
recentBearDiv = not na(lastBearDivBar) and bar_index - lastBearDivBar <= divMemory

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// GRADED SIGNALS - every wave turn scored on 5 checks: A = 4-5, B = 3, C = 0-2
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// A turn must come from a stretched wave (recent edge touch) to grade above C - like Cipher B's OB/OS dots
longScore = (touchedLower ? 1 : 0) + (htfUp ? 1 : 0) + (mfRising ? 1 : 0) + (flowBull ? 1 : 0) + (recentBullDiv ? 1 : 0)
shortScore = (touchedUpper ? 1 : 0) + (htfDn ? 1 : 0) + (mfFalling ? 1 : 0) + (flowBear ? 1 : 0) + (recentBearDiv ? 1 : 0)
longScore := touchedLower ? longScore : math.min(longScore, 2)
shortScore := touchedUpper ? shortScore : math.min(shortScore, 2)
gradeOf(int sc) =>
    sc >= 4 ? "A" : sc == 3 ? "B" : "C"
reasons(bool a, bool b, bool c, bool d, bool e) =>
    t = (a ? "stretched, " : "") + (b ? "HTF wave, " : "") + (c ? "money flow, " : "") + (d ? "capital flow, " : "") + (e ? "divergence, " : "")
    str.length(t) > 2 ? str.substring(t, 0, str.length(t) - 2) : "no confluence"

longGrade = crossUp ? gradeOf(longScore) : ""
shortGrade = crossDn ? gradeOf(shortScore) : ""
minScore = setupGrade == "A" ? 4 : 3
longSetup = crossUp and longScore >= minScore
shortSetup = crossDn and shortScore >= minScore
longAPlus = crossUp and longScore >= 4
shortAPlus = crossDn and shortScore >= 4

var string lastSigTxt = "none yet"
var string lastSigShort = "none yet"
var int lastSigBar = na
if crossUp and longScore >= 3
    lastSigTxt := longGrade + "-grade LONG (" + reasons(touchedLower, htfUp, mfRising, flowBull, recentBullDiv) + ")"
    lastSigShort := longGrade + "-grade long"
    lastSigBar := bar_index
if crossDn and shortScore >= 3
    lastSigTxt := shortGrade + "-grade SHORT (" + reasons(touchedUpper, htfDn, mfFalling, flowBear, recentBearDiv) + ")"
    lastSigShort := shortGrade + "-grade short"
    lastSigBar := bar_index

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// BLUE WAVE - anchor wave, smaller trigger wave, entry on the trigger's turn
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// Works in "dip" space: for shorts the wave is flipped, so one routine serves both sides.
// The anchor is the deepest dip in the bars before the current dip starts (the wave wiggles, so it
// isn't always the dip immediately before); the bounce is the highest point between anchor and trigger.
bwScan(bool isBull) =>
    w = isBull ? wt1 : -wt1
    dipStart = isBull ? crossDn : crossUp   // a new dip begins
    dipEnd = isBull ? crossUp : crossDn     // the dip turns - light blue crosses back over dark blue
    lowBefore = ta.lowest(w, bwMaxGap)[1]
    lowBeforeOff = ta.lowestbars(w, bwMaxGap)[1]
    var float dipLow = na
    var int dipBar = na
    var float anchorLow = na
    var int anchorBar = na
    var float bounce = na
    bool sig = false
    int aBar = na
    float aVal = na
    int tBar = na
    float tVal = na
    if dipStart
        dipLow := w
        dipBar := bar_index
        anchorLow := lowBefore
        anchorBar := bar_index - 1 + lowBeforeOff
        float hi = w
        for j = 0 to math.max(0, bar_index - anchorBar)
            hi := math.max(hi, w[j])
        bounce := hi
    else if not na(dipLow) and w < dipLow
        dipLow := w
        dipBar := bar_index
    if dipEnd and not na(dipLow)
        sig := not na(anchorLow) and dipLow < 0 and anchorLow <= -bwAnchorDepth and dipLow > anchorLow and math.abs(dipLow) <= math.abs(anchorLow) * bwTriggerRatio and bounce <= bwMaxBounce
        aBar := anchorBar
        aVal := isBull ? anchorLow : -anchorLow
        tBar := dipBar
        tVal := isBull ? dipLow : -dipLow
        dipLow := na
    [sig, aBar, aVal, tBar, tVal]

// Money flow behind it: moving the trade's way over the last few bars
mfSmoothFor(bool isBull) =>
    m = isBull ? moneyFlow : -moneyFlow
    m > m[bwMfLen]

[bwLongRaw, bwLA, bwLAV, bwLT, bwLTV] = bwScan(true)
[bwShortRaw, bwSA, bwSAV, bwST, bwSTV] = bwScan(false)
mfBullSmooth = mfSmoothFor(true)
mfBearSmooth = mfSmoothFor(false)
// One Blue Wave per anchor: later dips off the same anchor are not new setups
var int bwLongUsed = na
var int bwShortUsed = na
bwLong = showBlueWave and bwLongRaw and (not bwNeedMF or mfBullSmooth) and (na(bwLongUsed) or bwLA != bwLongUsed)
bwShort = showBlueWave and bwShortRaw and (not bwNeedMF or mfBearSmooth) and (na(bwShortUsed) or bwSA != bwShortUsed)
if bwLong
    bwLongUsed := bwLA
if bwShort
    bwShortUsed := bwSA

bw_color = #29B6F6
if bwLong and showBwLines
    line.new(bwLA, bwLAV, bwLT, bwLTV, color=color.new(bw_color, 25), style=line.style_dashed, width=1)
if bwShort and showBwLines
    line.new(bwSA, bwSAV, bwST, bwSTV, color=color.new(bw_color, 25), style=line.style_dashed, width=1)
if bwLong
    lastSigTxt := "BLUE WAVE LONG (anchor " + str.tostring(math.round(bwLAV)) + ", trigger " + str.tostring(math.round(bwLTV)) + ")"
    lastSigShort := "Blue Wave long"
    lastSigBar := bar_index
if bwShort
    lastSigTxt := "BLUE WAVE SHORT (anchor " + str.tostring(math.round(bwSAV)) + ", trigger " + str.tostring(math.round(bwSTV)) + ")"
    lastSigShort := "Blue Wave short"
    lastSigBar := bar_index

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// TRADE TRACKER - follows the last graded setup until the wave reaches the far band (wave ±100) or
// capital flow turns against it (the flow exit). TP1 / TP2 marks and alerts were removed 2026-10-17
// (untested targets); the tracker still ends a trade at the far band so flow exits fire as before
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

var int tradeDir = 0
var bool tp1Done = false

bool tp1Hit = false
bool tp2Hit = false
bool flowExit = false

if longSetup
    tradeDir := 1
    tp1Done := false
else if shortSetup
    tradeDir := -1
    tp1Done := false
else if tradeDir == 1
    if not tp1Done and rawPos >= 0
        tp1Hit := true
        tp1Done := true
    if tp1Done and rawPos >= 100
        tp2Hit := true
        tradeDir := 0
    else if flowBear
        flowExit := true
        tradeDir := 0
else if tradeDir == -1
    if not tp1Done and rawPos <= 0
        tp1Hit := true
        tp1Done := true
    if tp1Done and rawPos <= -100
        tp2Hit := true
        tradeDir := 0
    else if flowBull
        flowExit := true
        tradeDir := 0

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// PLOTTING - LEVELS
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// MC-style levels: 100 cap, 60 solid, 53 (momentum extreme) faint - only on the Momentum wave
mcLevels = isMomentum and showMcLevels
mc_line = #D1D4DC
hline(0, "Zero", color=color.new(level_color, 40), linestyle=hline.style_solid)
hline(obosLevel, "Overbought", color=mcLevels ? color.new(mc_line, 55) : color.new(level_color, 55), linestyle=mcLevels ? hline.style_solid : hline.style_dotted)
hline(-obosLevel, "Oversold", color=mcLevels ? color.new(mc_line, 55) : color.new(level_color, 55), linestyle=mcLevels ? hline.style_solid : hline.style_dotted)
hline(momEdgeLevel, "Momentum Extreme High", color=mcLevels ? color.new(mc_line, 75) : na, linestyle=hline.style_solid)
hline(-momEdgeLevel, "Momentum Extreme Low", color=mcLevels ? color.new(mc_line, 75) : na, linestyle=hline.style_solid)
hline(100, "Top", color=mcLevels ? color.new(mc_line, 55) : na, linestyle=hline.style_solid)
hline(-100, "Bottom", color=mcLevels ? color.new(mc_line, 75) : na, linestyle=hline.style_solid)
hline(100, "Upper Cloud Edge", color=isMomentum ? na : color.new(flow_bear, 55), linestyle=hline.style_dashed)
hline(-100, "Lower Cloud Edge", color=isMomentum ? na : color.new(flow_bull, 55), linestyle=hline.style_dashed)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// PLOTTING - WAVES & FLOW
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// MC-style layering: light fast wave underneath, dark slow wave on top,
// so the light leading edge shows wherever the fast wave runs ahead
// Money flow: where each candle closed within its range (+1 = closed on the high,
// -1 = closed on the low), optionally volume-weighted, averaged over mfLength bars
// Higher-timeframe wave: soft lavender area + thin line, drawn first so it sits behind
htf_col = #B39DDB
// Smoothed over about half a higher-timeframe bar so it reads as a curve, not a staircase
htfRatio = math.max(1, math.round(timeframe.in_seconds(htfRes) / secs / 2))
htfLine = ta.ema(htfW1, htfRatio)
plot(showHtfWave and htfOn ? htfLine : na, "HTF Wave Glow", color=color.new(htf_col, 88), linewidth=6, display=display.pane)
plot(showHtfWave and htfOn ? htfLine : na, "HTF Wave", color=color.new(htf_col, 30), linewidth=1, display=display.pane)

// Clean: money flow is a soft wash BEHIND the wave lines
plot(isClean and showMoneyFlow ? moneyFlow : na, "Money Flow (Clean)", color=moneyFlow >= 0 ? color.new(flow_bull, 78) : color.new(flow_bear, 78), style=plot.style_area, display=display.pane)

// Classic: MC-style layering - light fast wave underneath, dark slow wave on top
plot(isClean ? na : wt1, "Fast Wave", color=color.new(wave_fast, 5), style=plot.style_area, display=display.pane)
plot(isClean ? na : wt2, "Slow Wave", color=color.new(wave_slow, 8), style=plot.style_area, display=display.pane)

// Leading edge doubles as the RSI cue: red while overbought, green while oversold
rsiCue = ta.rsi(close, rsiCueLen)
rsiHot = rsiCueStyle == "Wave Edge" and (rsiCue > rsiOB or rsiCue < rsiOS)
edgeColor = rsiCueStyle == "Wave Edge" and rsiCue > rsiOB ? rsi_ob : rsiCueStyle == "Wave Edge" and rsiCue < rsiOS ? rsi_os : #9AD3FF
// Only where the light wave shows: once the fast wave slips inside the dark slow wave its fill is hidden,
// and an edge line left on top read as a stray white line over the dark wave
fastShows = wt1 >= 0 ? wt1 >= wt2 : wt1 <= wt2
plot(not isClean and fastShows ? wt1 : na, "Fast Wave Edge", color=color.new(#9AD3FF, 0), linewidth=1, style=plot.style_linebr)
plot(not isClean and rsiHot and fastShows ? wt1 : na, "RSI Edge", color=color.new(edgeColor, 0), linewidth=2, style=plot.style_linebr, display=display.pane)

// Clean: slow wave as a thin deep-blue line, fast wave as a bright line with a soft glow
clean_fast = rsiHot ? edgeColor : #4DA3FF
plot(isClean ? wt2 : na, "Slow Wave (Clean)", color=color.new(#3B5FC4, 0), linewidth=2, display=display.pane)
plot(isClean ? wt1 : na, "Fast Wave Glow", color=color.new(clean_fast, 82), linewidth=7, display=display.pane)
plot(isClean ? wt1 : na, "Fast Wave (Clean)", color=color.new(clean_fast, 0), linewidth=2, display=display.pane)

// Yellow momentum behind the money flow, MC-style (lightly smoothed so it doesn't flicker)
momentumDisplay = ta.ema(momentum, 3) * momScale
plot(showMomentum and (not isClean or cleanYellow) ? momentumDisplay : na, "Momentum", color=color.new(momentum_color, 8), style=plot.style_area, display=display.pane)

// Classic: money flow on top of the waves and the yellow momentum
mfColor = moneyFlow >= 0 ? color.new(flow_bull, mfTransp) : color.new(flow_bear, mfTransp)
plot(not isClean and showMoneyFlow ? moneyFlow : na, "Money Flow", color=mfColor, style=plot.style_area)


// Capital flow regime strip along the bottom - 3 brightness steps: weak / moderate / strong
stripTransp = conviction >= 0.5 ? 0 : conviction >= 0.2 ? 35 : 65
stripColor = flowBull ? color.new(flow_bull, stripTransp) : flowBear ? color.new(flow_bear, stripTransp) : color.new(level_color, 70)
plot(showFlowStrip and stripStyle == "Bars" ? -101 : na, "Capital Flow Strip", color=stripColor, style=plot.style_columns, histbase=-115, display=display.pane)
// Clean: one continuous band that only changes shade when conviction changes step
// Smoothed score + hysteresis so the band doesn't flicker bar to bar
bandScore = ta.ema(flowScore, 8)
var int bandStep = 0   // -3..+3: strong/moderate/weak bear, neutral, weak/moderate/strong bull
rawStep = bandScore >= 0.5 ? 3 : bandScore >= 0.2 ? 2 : bandScore > 0.08 ? 1 : bandScore <= -0.5 ? -3 : bandScore <= -0.2 ? -2 : bandScore < -0.08 ? -1 : 0
if rawStep == rawStep[1] and rawStep == rawStep[2]   // new shade must hold for 3 bars
    bandStep := rawStep
cleanStripColor = bandStep > 0 ? color.new(flow_bull, bandStep == 3 ? 5 : bandStep == 2 ? 35 : 60) :
     bandStep < 0 ? color.new(flow_bear, bandStep == -3 ? 5 : bandStep == -2 ? 35 : 60) : color.new(level_color, 70)
// Thicker than v3.3 so capital flow - the part no other Cipher-style oscillator has - reads at a glance
pBandTop = plot(showFlowStrip and stripStyle == "Band" ? -101 : na, "Flow Band Top", color=na, display=display.pane, editable=false)
pBandBot = plot(showFlowStrip and stripStyle == "Band" ? -115 : na, "Flow Band Bottom", color=na, display=display.pane, editable=false)
fill(pBandTop, pBandBot, color=cleanStripColor, title="Capital Flow Band")
// Name tag at the band's right end, so it's clear what the band is
var label bandTag = na
if barstate.islast and showFlowStrip
    label.delete(bandTag)
    bandWord = bandStep >= 2 ? "▲ CAPITAL FLOW IN" : bandStep <= -2 ? "▼ CAPITAL FLOW OUT" : bandStep == 1 ? "CAPITAL FLOW leaning in" : bandStep == -1 ? "CAPITAL FLOW leaning out" : "CAPITAL FLOW neutral"
    bandTag := label.new(bar_index + 2, -108, bandWord, color=color.new(#000000, 100), textcolor=bandStep > 0 ? flow_bull : bandStep < 0 ? flow_bear : #B2B5BE, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.small)

// Capital flow flips - same rule as the overlay's flip dots
var int flowDir = 0
bullHeld = math.sum(flowScore > flipLevel ? 1 : 0, flipConfirm) == flipConfirm
bearHeld = math.sum(flowScore < -flipLevel ? 1 : 0, flipConfirm) == flipConfirm
flipToBullish = bullHeld and flowDir != 1
flipToBearish = bearHeld and flowDir != -1
if flipToBullish
    flowDir := 1
if flipToBearish
    flowDir := -1

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// CAPITAL FLOW SIGNAL - the signature: momentum, money and macro agree on the same bar
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
cfLong = showCF and crossUp and touchedLower and mfRising and flowDir == 1 and flowScore > 0
cfShort = showCF and crossDn and touchedUpper and mfFalling and flowDir == -1 and flowScore < 0
cf_color = #FFD54F
if cfLong
    lastSigTxt := "CAPITAL FLOW LONG (stretched wave turning up, money flow rising, capital flow bullish)"
    lastSigShort := "Capital Flow long"
    lastSigBar := bar_index
if cfShort
    lastSigTxt := "CAPITAL FLOW SHORT (stretched wave turning down, money flow falling, capital flow bearish)"
    lastSigShort := "Capital Flow short"
    lastSigBar := bar_index

// Capital flow pressure - the overlay's cloud colour as a faint tint.
// Flip State: one steady shade between flips. Live Score: overlay rule (green above +5%, red below -5%), stronger flow = stronger tint
pressureAmt = math.min(math.abs(flowScore), 1.0) * pressureStrength
liveTransp = math.round(math.max(70, 94 - pressureAmt * 20))
stateTransp = math.round(math.max(75, 96 - pressureStrength * 5))
pressureColor = not showPressure ? na :
     pressureMode == "Flip State" ? (flowDir == 1 ? color.new(flow_bull, stateTransp) : flowDir == -1 ? color.new(flow_bear, stateTransp) : na) :
     flowScore > 0.05 ? color.new(flow_bull, liveTransp) : flowScore < -0.05 ? color.new(flow_bear, liveTransp) : na
bgcolor(pressureColor, title="Capital Flow Pressure")

// RSI cue (Dots style): small faint dots riding on the fast wave
plotshape(rsiCueStyle == "Dots" and rsiCue > rsiOB ? wt1 : na, "RSI Overbought", shape.circle, location.absolute, color.new(rsi_ob, 45), size=size.auto, display=display.pane)
plotshape(rsiCueStyle == "Dots" and rsiCue < rsiOS ? wt1 : na, "RSI Oversold", shape.circle, location.absolute, color.new(rsi_os, 45), size=size.auto, display=display.pane)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// PLOTTING - DOTS & MARKS
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// Each dot is drawn twice - a dark disc one size up, then the colour on top - for an outlined look
dot_outline = color.new(#0B0E1A, 0)

// Capital flow flip dots, centred on the bottom band
plotshape(showFlipDots and (flipToBullish or flipToBearish) ? -108 : na, "Flip Dot Outline", shape.circle, location.absolute, dot_outline, size=size.small, display=display.pane, editable=false)
plotshape(showFlipDots and flipToBullish ? -108 : na, "Bull Flip", shape.circle, location.absolute, flow_bull, size=size.tiny, display=display.pane)
plotshape(showFlipDots and flipToBearish ? -108 : na, "Bear Flip", shape.circle, location.absolute, flow_bear, size=size.tiny, display=display.pane)
dotLevel = isClean ? math.max(dotMinLevel, 45) : dotMinLevel
// C-grade turns = small dots, B = outlined dots, A = outlined dots with a green / red ring
smallUp = showSmallDots and crossUp and longScore <= 2 and math.abs(wt2) >= dotLevel
smallDn = showSmallDots and crossDn and shortScore <= 2 and math.abs(wt2) >= dotLevel
setupLong = crossUp and longScore == 3
setupShort = crossDn and shortScore == 3

plotshape(smallUp ? wt2 : na, "Wave Cross Up", shape.circle, location.absolute, dot_bull, size=size.tiny)
plotshape(smallDn ? wt2 : na, "Wave Cross Down", shape.circle, location.absolute, dot_bear, size=size.tiny)

gradedLong = setupLong or longAPlus
gradedShort = setupShort or shortAPlus
plotshape(gradedLong or gradedShort ? wt2 : na, "Setup Dot Outline", shape.circle, location.absolute, dot_outline, size=size.small, display=display.pane)
plotshape(gradedLong or gradedShort ? wt2 : na, "B Dot", shape.circle, location.absolute, gradedLong ? dot_bull : dot_bear, size=size.tiny)

// A = the same outlined dot plus a thin ring in its own colour (fixed-colour plotchars: 2 plots, the old A dot took 3)
plotchar(longAPlus ? wt2 : na, "A Ring Long", "○", location.absolute, dot_bull, size=size.tiny, display=display.pane)
plotchar(shortAPlus ? wt2 : na, "A Ring Short", "○", location.absolute, dot_bear, size=size.tiny, display=display.pane)

// Blue Wave: blue diamond just beyond the turn - below the wave for longs, above for shorts
// Capital Flow signal: a gold dot in a thin gold ring, long or short (drawn after the graded dots and A rings so
// gold covers them; the user wanted the signature signal all gold, 2026-10-17)
plotshape(cfLong or cfShort ? wt2 : na, "Capital Flow Dot", shape.circle, location.absolute, cf_color, size=size.tiny, display=display.pane)
plotchar(cfLong or cfShort ? wt2 : na, "Capital Flow Signal", "○", location.absolute, cf_color, size=size.tiny, display=display.pane)
bwY = bwLong ? wt2 - 14 : bwShort ? wt2 + 14 : na
plotshape(bwY, "Blue Wave", shape.diamond, location.absolute, bw_color, size=size.tiny, display=display.pane)

plotshape(showExitMarks and flowExit ? wt1 : na, "Flow Exit", shape.xcross, location.absolute, exit_color, size=size.tiny)


// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// STATUS BOX (table, so it never gets cut off at the chart edge)
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

boxPos = switch labelPos
    "Bottom Right" => position.bottom_right
    "Bottom Left" => position.bottom_left
    "Top Left" => position.top_left
    => position.top_right
var table statusBox = table.new(boxPos, 2, 4, bgcolor=color.new(#0d1117, 25), frame_color=color.new(#363A45, 40), frame_width=1, border_width=0)
// Only one table can show per corner: park the (empty) Clean score cards elsewhere in Classic style
var table cardBox = table.new(isClean ? boxPos : position.top_center, 3, 1, bgcolor=color.new(#131722, 0), frame_color=color.new(#363A45, 0), frame_width=1, border_color=color.new(#363A45, 0), border_width=1)

if barstate.islast and showLabel and isClean
    scoreTxt = (flowScore >= 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(math.round(flowScore * 100)) + "%"
    stateTxt = math.abs(flowScore) > 0.7 ? "Full Send" : math.abs(flowScore) > 0.5 ? "Standard" : math.abs(flowScore) > 0.2 ? "Lean" : "Neutral"
    scoreCol = flowScore > 0.05 ? flow_bull : flowScore < -0.05 ? flow_bear : #B2B5BE
    stateCol = math.abs(flowScore) > 0.2 ? #FF9F43 : #B2B5BE
    table.cell(cardBox, 0, 0, "Flow score\n" + scoreTxt, text_color=scoreCol, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
    table.cell(cardBox, 1, 0, "Confluence\n" + str.tostring(math.max(bullCount, bearCount)) + " / 8", text_color=#E6E9EF, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
    table.cell(cardBox, 2, 0, "State\n" + stateTxt, text_color=stateCol, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)

// "240" -> "4H", "60" -> "1H", "1D", "1W", "1M", "15m"
tfShort(string tf) =>
    s = timeframe.in_seconds(tf)
    s % 2592000 == 0 and s >= 2592000 ? str.tostring(math.round(s / 2592000)) + "M" : s % 604800 == 0 ? str.tostring(math.round(s / 604800)) + "W" : s % 86400 == 0 ? str.tostring(math.round(s / 86400)) + "D" : s % 3600 == 0 ? str.tostring(math.round(s / 3600)) + "H" : str.tostring(math.round(s / 60)) + "m"
arrowOf(bool upCond) =>
    upCond ? "▲" : "▼"
// Bars back as clock time ("45m", "5h", "3d", "2w") - easier to read than a bar count
agoTxt(int bars) =>
    agoSecs = bars * timeframe.in_seconds()
    agoSecs < 3600 ? str.tostring(math.round(agoSecs / 60)) + "m" : agoSecs < 86400 ? str.tostring(math.round(agoSecs / 3600)) + "h" : agoSecs < 1209600 ? str.tostring(math.round(agoSecs / 86400)) + "d" : str.tostring(math.round(agoSecs / 604800)) + "w"

if barstate.islast and showLabel and not isClean
    zone = wt1 <= -setupEdge ? " deep OS" : wt1 >= setupEdge ? " deep OB" : wt1 <= -obosLevel ? " OS" : wt1 >= obosLevel ? " OB" : ""
    cfTxt = (flowBull ? "▲ BULL " : flowBear ? "▼ BEAR " : "• NEUTRAL ") + str.tostring(math.round(flowScore * 100)) + "%  " + str.tostring(math.max(bullCount, bearCount)) + "/8"
    waveTxt = str.tostring(math.round(wt1)) + zone + " " + arrowOf(wt1 > wt2) + (not htfOn or na(htfW1) ? "" : "   HTF " + tfShort(htfRes) + " " + arrowOf(htfW1 > htfW2))
    divAgeBull = na(shownBullDivBar) ? 9999 : bar_index - shownBullDivBar
    divAgeBear = na(shownBearDivBar) ? 9999 : bar_index - shownBearDivBar
    divTxt = math.min(divAgeBull, divAgeBear) <= 30 ? "   " + (divAgeBull <= divAgeBear ? (shownBullHidden ? "hidden " : "") + "bull div " + agoTxt(divAgeBull) : (shownBearHidden ? "hidden " : "") + "bear div " + agoTxt(divAgeBear)) + " ago" : ""
    mfTxt = (moneyFlow > 0 ? "buyers" : "sellers") + (mfRising ? " ↗" : mfFalling ? " ↘" : "") + divTxt
    sigTxt = lastSigShort + (na(lastSigBar) ? "" : "  " + agoTxt(bar_index - lastSigBar) + " ago")
    cfCol = flowBull ? flow_bull : flowBear ? flow_bear : #B2B5BE
    dim = #787B86
    table.cell(statusBox, 0, 0, "CAPITAL FLOW", text_color=dim, text_size=size.tiny, text_halign=text.align_left)
    table.cell(statusBox, 1, 0, cfTxt, text_color=cfCol, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
    table.cell(statusBox, 0, 1, "WAVE", text_color=dim, text_size=size.tiny, text_halign=text.align_left)
    table.cell(statusBox, 1, 1, waveTxt, text_color=#E6E9EF, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
    table.cell(statusBox, 0, 2, usingDelta ? "VOLUME DELTA" : "MONEY FLOW", text_color=dim, text_size=size.tiny, text_halign=text.align_left)
    table.cell(statusBox, 1, 2, mfTxt, text_color=moneyFlow > 0 ? flow_bull : flow_bear, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
    table.cell(statusBox, 0, 3, "LAST SIGNAL", text_color=dim, text_size=size.tiny, text_halign=text.align_left)
    table.cell(statusBox, 1, 3, sigTxt, text_color=str.contains(lastSigShort, "Capital Flow") ? cf_color : str.contains(lastSigShort, "Blue Wave") ? bw_color : lastSigShort == "A-grade long" ? dot_bull : lastSigShort == "A-grade short" ? dot_bear : #E6E9EF, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// KEY
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

keyBoxPos = switch keyPos
    "Top Left" => position.top_left
    "Top Right" => position.top_right
    "Bottom Right" => position.bottom_right
    => position.bottom_left
var table keyBox = table.new(keyBoxPos, 1, 15, bgcolor=color.new(#0d1117, 5), frame_color=color.new(#787B86, 40), frame_width=1, border_width=0)

keyRow(int row, string txt, color col) =>
    table.cell(keyBox, 0, row, txt, text_color=col, text_size=size.tiny, text_halign=text.align_left)

if barstate.islast and showKey
    keyRow(0, "KEY", color.new(#d1d4dc, 0))
    keyRow(1, "Blue waves: light = fast, dark = slow", wave_fast)
    keyRow(2, "Green / red area: money flow (buy vs sell volume)", flow_bull)
    keyRow(3, "Yellow: momentum (turns before the waves cross)", momentum_color)
    keyRow(4, "Red / green wave edge: RSI over " + str.tostring(rsiOB) + " / under " + str.tostring(rsiOS), rsi_ob)
    keyRow(5, "Bottom strip: capital flow (green = longs, red = shorts)", color.new(#d1d4dc, 0))
    keyRow(6, "Outlined dot: B-grade turn (3 of 5 checks)" + (showSmallDots ? "   Plain dot: C-grade" : ""), dot_bull)
    keyRow(7, "Green / red ring: A-grade (4-5 of: stretched, HTF, money flow, capital flow, divergence)", dot_bull)
    keyRow(8, "x: flow exit (capital flow turned against the last setup)", exit_color)
    keyRow(9, "Lines: divergence (bold = wave, RSI and flow agree)", div_bear)
    keyRow(10, "Lavender wave: higher-timeframe wave", #B39DDB)
    keyRow(11, "Gold dot in a gold ring: Capital Flow signal (stretched wave turn + money flow + capital flow agree)", cf_color)
    keyRow(12, "Green / red tint: capital flow pressure (" + (pressureMode == "Flip State" ? "since the last flip)" : "live score)"), flow_bull)
    keyRow(13, "Dots on the bottom band: capital flow flips (the overlay's flip dots)", flow_bear)
    keyRow(14, "Blue diamond + dashed line: Blue Wave (deep anchor wave, smaller trigger, smooth money flow)", bw_color)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ALERTS
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

var int lastSetupAlertBar = -1000
canAlert = bar_index - lastSetupAlertBar >= alertCooldown

fireLong = alertSetups and canAlert and (alertAPlusOnly ? longAPlus : longSetup)
fireShort = alertSetups and canAlert and (alertAPlusOnly ? shortAPlus : shortSetup)
fireExit = alertExit and flowExit

if fireLong or fireShort
    lastSetupAlertBar := bar_index

// Alert messages are written for a person reading them on a phone: what happened, where, the price, and why
tfText = timeframe.isminutes ? (timeframe.multiplier % 60 == 0 ? str.tostring(timeframe.multiplier / 60) + "H" : timeframe.period + "m") : timeframe.isdaily ? (timeframe.multiplier == 1 ? "Daily" : timeframe.period) : timeframe.isweekly ? "Weekly" : timeframe.ismonthly ? "Monthly" : timeframe.period
htfText = htfRes == "1W" ? "weekly" : htfRes == "1M" ? "monthly" : timeframe.in_seconds(htfRes) % 86400 == 0 ? "daily" : str.tostring(timeframe.in_seconds(htfRes) / 3600) + "H"
scoreText = (flowScore >= 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(math.round(flowScore * 100)) + "%"
agreeText = str.tostring(flowScore >= 0 ? bullCount : bearCount) + " of 8 markets agree"
flowWord = flowScore > minFlow ? "bullish" : flowScore < -minFlow ? "bearish" : "neutral"
tickerText = syminfo.ticker + " " + tfText
priceText = "Price " + str.tostring(close, "#,##0.########")
flowLine = "Capital flow " + flowWord + " " + scoreText + " (" + agreeText + ")"

// The checks behind a graded dot, in plain words
whyText(bool isLong, bool stretched, bool htf, bool mf, bool cf, bool dv) =>
    t = (stretched ? (isLong ? "turned up from oversold, " : "turned down from overbought, ") : "") +
         (htf ? htfText + " wave " + (isLong ? "rising" : "falling") + ", " : "") +
         (mf ? (isLong ? "buyers stepping in, " : "sellers stepping in, ") : "") +
         (cf ? "capital flow " + (isLong ? "bullish" : "bearish") + ", " : "") +
         (dv ? (isLong ? "bullish" : "bearish") + " divergence, " : "")
    str.length(t) > 2 ? str.substring(t, 0, str.length(t) - 2) : "momentum turn only"

tradeWord = tradeDir[1] == 1 ? "long" : "short"

if fireLong
    alert("🟢 " + (longAPlus ? "A" : "B") + "-grade LONG · " + tickerText + "\n" + priceText + "\nWhy: " + whyText(true, touchedLower, htfUp, mfRising, flowBull, recentBullDiv) + "\n" + flowLine, alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if fireShort
    alert("🔴 " + (shortAPlus ? "A" : "B") + "-grade SHORT · " + tickerText + "\n" + priceText + "\nWhy: " + whyText(false, touchedUpper, htfDn, mfFalling, flowBear, recentBearDiv) + "\n" + flowLine, alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if alertDiv and bullDiv and bullDivStrength >= divMinStrength
    alert("📈 Bullish divergence · " + tickerText + "\n" + priceText + (str.contains(lastBullDivTxt, "hidden") ? "\nHidden divergence: price made a higher low while momentum made a lower low (uptrend continuation)" : "\nPrice made a lower low but momentum did not") + " · strength " + str.tostring(bullDivStrength) + " of 3", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if alertDiv and bearDiv and bearDivStrength >= divMinStrength
    alert("📉 Bearish divergence · " + tickerText + "\n" + priceText + (str.contains(lastBearDivTxt, "hidden") ? "\nHidden divergence: price made a lower high while momentum made a higher high (downtrend continuation)" : "\nPrice made a higher high but momentum did not") + " · strength " + str.tostring(bearDivStrength) + " of 3", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if alertBW and bwLong
    alert("🔵 BLUE WAVE LONG · " + tickerText + "\n" + priceText + "\nA second, shallower dip (wave " + str.tostring(math.round(bwLTV)) + " after " + str.tostring(math.round(bwLAV)) + ") has turned up with buyers behind it\n" + flowLine, alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if alertCF and cfLong
    alert("🟡 CAPITAL FLOW LONG · " + tickerText + "\n" + priceText + "\nAll three agree: momentum turned up from oversold, buyers stepping in, capital flow bullish\n" + flowLine, alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if alertCF and cfShort
    alert("🟡 CAPITAL FLOW SHORT · " + tickerText + "\n" + priceText + "\nAll three agree: momentum turned down from overbought, sellers stepping in, capital flow bearish\n" + flowLine, alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if alertBW and bwShort
    alert("🔵 BLUE WAVE SHORT · " + tickerText + "\n" + priceText + "\nA second, smaller peak (wave " + str.tostring(math.round(bwSTV)) + " after " + str.tostring(math.round(bwSAV)) + ") has turned down with sellers behind it\n" + flowLine, alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if fireExit
    alert("✕ Capital flow turned against the last " + tradeWord + " · " + tickerText + "\n" + priceText + "\n" + flowLine, alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)

alertcondition(fireLong, title="Graded LONG", message="Graded long signal on {{ticker}} {{interval}} (B or A grade)")
alertcondition(fireShort, title="Graded SHORT", message="Graded short signal on {{ticker}} {{interval}} (B or A grade)")
alertcondition(bullDiv and bullDivStrength >= divMinStrength, title="Bull Divergence", message="Bullish divergence on {{ticker}} {{interval}}")
alertcondition(bearDiv and bearDivStrength >= divMinStrength, title="Bear Divergence", message="Bearish divergence on {{ticker}} {{interval}}")
alertcondition(flipToBullish, title="Capital Flow Flip Bullish", message="Capital flow flipped BULLISH on {{ticker}} {{interval}}")
alertcondition(flipToBearish, title="Capital Flow Flip Bearish", message="Capital flow flipped BEARISH on {{ticker}} {{interval}}")
alertcondition(bwLong, title="Blue Wave LONG", message="Blue Wave long on {{ticker}} {{interval}} - deep anchor wave, smaller trigger wave, smooth money flow")
alertcondition(cfLong, title="Capital Flow LONG", message="Capital Flow long on {{ticker}} {{interval}} - stretched wave turning up, money flow rising, capital flow bullish")
alertcondition(cfShort, title="Capital Flow SHORT", message="Capital Flow short on {{ticker}} {{interval}} - stretched wave turning down, money flow falling, capital flow bearish")
alertcondition(bwShort, title="Blue Wave SHORT", message="Blue Wave short on {{ticker}} {{interval}} - deep anchor wave, smaller trigger wave, smooth money flow")
alertcondition(fireExit, title="Flow Exit", message="Capital flow flipped against the open setup on {{ticker}} {{interval}}")

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// DATA EXPORTS
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

plot(flowScore, title="Flow Score", display=display.none)
// (Setup, Signal Score, Trade State, Money Flow and Wave Value exports removed in v3.4 for Blue Wave - 64-plot limit;
// money flow and the fast wave are still readable from their visible plots)
